      "startupConfig": "hostname D1\nno ip domain-lookup\nspanning-tree mode pvst\nvlan 10\n name BUREAUX\nvlan 20\n name ATELIER\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/1\n description Vers D2\n switchport mode trunk\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/2\n description Vers A1\n switchport mode trunk"
    },
